IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CAESAR.
*> Author: Nishant-codess

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-MODE      PIC X.
01 WS-SHIFT     PIC 9(2).
01 WS-MSG       PIC X(100).
01 WS-RESULT    PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-LEN       PIC 9(3).
01 WS-I         PIC 9(3).
01 WS-CHAR      PIC X.
01 WS-ORD       PIC 9(3).
01 WS-NEW-ORD   PIC 9(3).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Mode (E/D): " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-MODE

    DISPLAY "Shift (1-25): " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-SHIFT

    DISPLAY "Message: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-MSG

    MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-MSG) TO WS-MSG
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-MSG)) TO WS-LEN

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-LEN
        MOVE WS-MSG(WS-I:1) TO WS-CHAR

        IF WS-CHAR >= "A" AND WS-CHAR <= "Z"
            COMPUTE WS-ORD = FUNCTION ORD(WS-CHAR)

            IF WS-MODE = "E"
                COMPUTE WS-NEW-ORD =
                    FUNCTION MOD(WS-ORD - 65 + WS-SHIFT, 26) + 65
            ELSE
                COMPUTE WS-NEW-ORD =
                    FUNCTION MOD(WS-ORD - 65 - WS-SHIFT + 26, 26) + 65
            END-IF

            MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(WS-NEW-ORD)
                TO WS-RESULT(WS-I:1)
        ELSE
            MOVE WS-CHAR TO WS-RESULT(WS-I:1)
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM

    DISPLAY WS-RESULT(1:WS-LEN)

    STOP RUN.
